  gold diamond tip, strikes a refraction node at (54,52) and fans into three diverging rays
  — violet, indigo-violet and cyan — a single light refracted into a short spectrum. The
  beam is a tapered quad (half-width 3.6 at the tip -> 4.6 at the node) filled with a vertical
  violet gradient #B79CFF -> #7C5CFF; the fan rays are flat #B79CFF (left), #7C5CFF (centre)
  and #3FE0D0 (right); the tip diamond is gold #F5C97A. A 28% black copy offset +1.4 Y is
  the shadow. The mark is balanced in the 66-unit safe circle. Same geometry as
  tools/generate_launcher_icons.py.
-->
